Petitioner has relied upon the following documents viz:-
"Ex PW1/1 is certified copy of FIR;
Ex PW1/2 is certified copy of chargesheet; Ex PW1/3 is certified copy of site plan; Ex PW1/4 is de-exhibited as Mark A which is a copy of mechanical inspection report of offending vehicle;
Kanchan Basnet (I) (Petition) vs Rambeer (Sbi Gen. Ins.) on 13 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/6827493/
4 Ex PW1/5 is copy of cover note of offending vehicle'

EX PW1/6 is copy of RC of offending vehicle; Ex PW1/7 is MLC of petitioner prepared by Dev Nandini Hospital;
Ex PW1/8 is copy of DL of R-1;
Ex PW1/9 is copy of Aadhar Card of Petitioner (OSR); Ex PW1/10 are medical bills and prescriptions of Dev Nandini Hospital (Colly);
